## The Finding
Prospector beat `academic_intraday_anomalies` surfaced: Opening Range Breakout (ORB) effect – intraday SPY moves after the first 30‑minute range -- Breakouts of the opening range capture early trader imbalance and tend to continue for several minutes, providing directional edge for 0DTE SPY options. Data source: CRSP intraday data accessed via WRDS (https://wrds-web.wharton.upenn.edu). Cost: paid. Instrument fit: 0dte.

